WEBVTT

01:07:28.038 --> 01:07:33.871
but also an opportunity to figure out what
not means and how we want the world

01:07:33.871 --> 01:07:35.871
and this sort of one time shift to go

01:07:38.954 --> 01:07:39.121
on.

01:07:39.413 --> 01:07:42.871
I'm kind of awed by the breadth
of things are engaged with.

01:07:43.038 --> 01:07:46.204
Thank you so much for spending so
much time sharing your vision.

01:07:46.454 --> 01:07:47.454
Thanks so much for having me.

01:07:58.579 --> 01:08:02.496
OK, that's it for today. You can
read more about open eyes,